{"strongs": "H5158", "word": "נַ֫חַל", "translit": "na.chal", "root": "נחל", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "torrent, torrent-valley, wady", "definition": "I. נַ֫חַל noun masculine 2Kgs 3:16 torrent, torrent-valley, wady ( Eccl 40:13 ; Eccl 40:16 Late Hebrew id., stream (rare); ᵑ7 נַחְלָא , = Biblical Hebrew; Assyrian na—lu = Biblical Hebrew; Lag BN 140 Anm. thinks Νεῖλος may be from Νεέλ = נַחַל pronounced * נִהִל ; on ׳ נ in Sabean proper name, of a location, see Hal Rev. Sémit. Iv (1896), 80, 1, 14 ); — absolute ׳ נ Gen 32:24 +, נַ֫חְלָה Ps 124:4 construct נַחַל Gen 26:17 +; with ה locative, Gen 34:5 so read also Ezek 47:19 ; Ezek 48:28 (where ᵑ0 נַחֲלָ֫ה ; see Thes ); dual נַחֲלַיִם Ezek 47:9 , but read הַנַּחַל ᵐ5 . ᵑ7 ᵑ6 ᵑ9 Co Berthol ; plural נְחָלִים Num 21:4 +; נַחֲלֵי Deut 8:7 +; suffix נְחֶלֶיהָ Isa 34:9 — 1. torrent , of rushing water in narrow channel Judg 5:21 (3 t. in verse); Judg 4:7 ; Judg 4:13 ; Ps 83:10 (all of קִישֹׁן , q. v.); mountain torrent Deut 9:21 (compare Exod 32:20 ); so Amos 5:24 (simile of righteousness); הַשּׁוֺטֵף ׳ הַנּ 2Chr 32:4 (|| מַעְיָנוֺת ); לְזֶפֶת ׳ נֶהְפְּכוּ נ Isa 34:9 simile of tears Lam 2:18 hyperb. שָֿׁ֑מֶן ׳ נ Mic 6:7 torrents of oil , compare of honey and curd Job 20:17 (|| פְּלַגּוֺת , נְהָרִים ); figurative בְלִיַּעַל ׳ נ 2Sam 22:5 torrents of worthlessness (|| מִשְׁבְּרֵי מָ֫וֶת ), = Ps 18:5 שׁוֺטֵף ׳ נ simile of glory of nations Isa 66:12 , figurative of invaders Jer 47:2 (|| מַיִס ), or foes Ps 124:4 ( נַ֫חְלָה , see above); 1Kgs 17:4 ; 1Kgs 17:6 (for drinking), drying up in summer v 1Kgs 17:7 ( יָבֵשׁ ; all of Elijah's stream כְּרִית , q. v.); for drinking also Ps 110:7 , and (figurative) עֲדָנֶיךָ ׳ נ Ps 36:9 ; Job 6:15 (twice in verse) ( אֲפִיק נְחָלִים ; in simile); of water bursting from rock Ps 78:20 ( שָׁטַף , || מַיִם ), compare Ps 74:15 (+ מַעְיָן ); figurative of מְקוֺר חָכְמָה Prov 18:4 ( נֹבֵּעַ ׳ נ ; || מַיִם עֲמֻקִים ); more generally = stream, brook, river (chiefly late) Isa 11:15 (divisions of river, נָהָר ) in desert Isa 35:6 (|| מַיִם ), Jer 31:9 ( נַחֲלֵי מַיִם ), Ezek 47:5 (twice in verse); Ezek 47:9 b (all strike out Co ), v Ezek 47:6 v Ezek 47:7 v Ezek 47:9 a (read הַנַּחַל , see above), v Ezek 47:12 containing fish, etc. Lev 11:9 ; Lev 11:10 (|| מַיִם , יַמִּים ), Eccl 1:7 (twice in verse); figurative ׳ רוּחַ י , Isa 30:28 ( שׁוֺטֵף ׳ נ , Isa 30:33 ( גָּפְרִית ׳ נ ). 2. Torrent-valley, wady , as stream-bed 1Sam 17:40 ; Neh 2:15 ; Isa 57:6 with torrent flowing through it, אֵיתָן ׳ נ Deut 21:4 (twice in verse); Deut 21:6 , אֶרֶץ נַחֲלֵי מַיִם Deut 8:7 (|| עֲיָנֹת וּתְהֹמֹת יֹּצְאִים בַּבִּקְעָה ), compare Deut 10:7 , 1Kgs 18:5 (|| מַעְיְנֵי הַמַיִם ), Ps 104:10 abode of Elijah 1Kgs 17:3 ; 1Kgs 17:5 (compare v 1Kgs 17:4 v 1Kgs 17:6 v 1Kgs 17:7 above); ׳ עֹרְבֵי נ Prov 30:17 (compare 1Kgs 17:4 ; 1Kgs 17:6 ); הַבַּתּוֺת ׳ נ Isa 7:19 as home of bees; fertile, אֶשְׁכֹּל ׳ נ Num 13:23 ; Num 13:24 ( E ); ׳ אִבֵּי הַנּ Song 6:11 ׳ עַרְבֵינֿ poplars of the wady Lev 23:40 ( H ), Job 40:22 עֲרָבִים ׳ נ Isa 15:7 needing water Gen 26:17 ( גְּרָר ׳ נ ), v Gen 26:19 ( J ), compare 2Kgs 3:16 ; 2Kgs 3:17 place for refuse, ruins, etc. 2Sam 17:13 in poetry also as wild, remote ravine Job 30:6 , compare בְּצוּר הַנְּחָלִים Job 22:24 place of child-sacrifice Isa 57:5 burial-place Job 21:33 ( ׳ רִגְבֵי נ ), — Num 24:6 see II. נַ֫חַל . [Note] Particular wadys designate localities: אַרְנוֺן Num 21:14 ( E ), Deut 2:24 ; Deut 2:36 (twice in verse); Deut 3:8 ; Deut 3:12 ; Deut 3:16 (twice in verse); Deut 4:48 ; Josh 12:1 ; Josh 12:2 (twice in verse); Josh 13:9 (twice in verse) (all D ), v Josh 13:16 v Josh 13:16 ( P ), 2Kgs 10:33 אֶשְׁכֹּל Num 32:9 ( J ), Deut 1:24 בְּשׂוֺר 1Sam 30:9 ; 1Sam 30:10 ; 1Sam 30:21 גָּד 2Sam 24:5 זֶרֶד Num 21:12 ( E ), Deut 2:13 (twice in verse); Deut 2:14 יַכֹּק Gen 32:24 ( J ), Deut 2:37 ; Deut 3:16 ; Josh 12:2 (all D ); קִדְרוֺן 2Sam 15:23 ; 2Sam 1:37 ; 2Sam 15:13 ; 2Sam 18:40 ; 2Sam 23:6 (twice in verse); 2Sam 23:12 ; 2Chr 15:16 ; 2Chr 29:16 ; 2Chr 30:14 ; Jer 31:40 קָנָה Josh 16:8 ; Josh 17:9 (3 t. in verse) (all P ); שׂוֺרֵק Judg 16:4 הַשִּׁטִּים ׳ נ Joel 4:18 ׳ נ מִצְרַיִם is southwest limit of Palestine (Assyrian na—al [ mat ] Muƒri , Dl Par. 310 Schr COT Num 34:5 ) Num 34:5 ( P ), Josh 15:4 ( D ), v Josh 15:47 ( P ), 1Kgs 8:65 ; 2Kgs 24:7 ; 2Kgs 24:2 Chron 2Kgs 7:8 ; Isa 27:12 , + (omit מצרים ) Ezek 47:19 ; Ezek 48:28 (see above); so read also possibly Amos 6:14 (see עֲרָבָה : usually identified with Wâdy el-Arîsh ; on Wkl's different view, see references below מִצְרַיִם near the end); on identification of ׳ נ Josh 15:7 ; Josh 19:11 (both P ), 2Sam 23:30 = 1Chr 11:32 ; 2Chr 20:16 ; 2Chr 33:14 , see Commentaries; אָשֶׁד הַנְּחָלִים Num 21:15 , see אֶשֶׁד . 3. Miner's shaft , ׳ פָּרַץ נ Job 28:4 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5112')\">BDB5112</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5158')\">H5158</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5111')\">BDB5111</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5113')\">BDB5113</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>נַ֫חַל</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"2Kgs 3:16\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(12,3,16)\">2Kgs 3:16</ref></sup> <highlightword>torrent, torrent-valley, wady</highlightword> (<checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Eccl 40:13\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(21,40,13)\">Eccl 40:13</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Eccl 40:16\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(21,40,16)\">Eccl 40:16</ref> Late Hebrew id., stream (rare); <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>נַחְלָא</bdbheb> <placeholder3265/>, = Biblical Hebrew; Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>na—lu</highlight></transliteration> = Biblical Hebrew; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>BN 140 Anm.</sup></lookup> thinks <grk>Νεῖλος</grk> may be from <grk>Νεέλ</grk> = <bdbheb>נַחַל</bdbheb> pronounced *<bdbheb>נִהִל</bdbheb>; on <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> in Sabean proper name, of a location, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hal')\">Hal<sup>Rev. Sémit. Iv (1896), 80, 1, 14</sup></lookup>); — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 32:24\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,24)\">Gen 32:24</ref> +, <bdbheb>נַ֫חְלָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 124:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"124\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"124\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,124,4)\">Ps 124:4</ref> construct <bdbheb>נַחַל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 26:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,26,17)\">Gen 26:17</ref> +; with <bdbheb>ה</bdbheb> locative, <ref ref=\"Gen 34:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,34,5)\">Gen 34:5</ref> so read also <ref ref=\"Ezek 47:19\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(26,47,19)\">Ezek 47:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 48:28\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(26,48,28)\">Ezek 48:28</ref> (where <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>נַחֲלָ֫ה</bdbheb>; see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Thes')\">Thes</lookup>); dual <bdbheb>נַחֲלַיִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 47:9\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(26,47,9)\">Ezek 47:9</ref>, but read <bdbheb>הַנַּחַל</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>. <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Syr')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ6</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ9</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Berthol')\">Berthol</lookup>; plural <bdbheb>נְחָלִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 21:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,21,4)\">Num 21:4</ref> +; <bdbheb>נַחֲלֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 8:7\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(5,8,7)\">Deut 8:7</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>נְחֶלֶיהָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 34:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,34,9)\">Isa 34:9</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>torrent</highlight>, of rushing water in narrow channel <ref ref=\"Judg 5:21\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,21)\">Judg 5:21</ref> (3 t. in verse); <ref ref=\"Judg 4:7\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,7)\">Judg 4:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 4:13\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,13)\">Judg 4:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 83:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"83\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"83\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,83,10)\">Ps 83:10</ref> (all of <bdbheb>קִישֹׁן</bdbheb>, q. v.); mountain torrent <ref ref=\"Deut 9:21\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(5,9,21)\">Deut 9:21</ref> (compare <ref ref=\"Exod 32:20\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(2,32,20)\">Exod 32:20</ref>); so <ref ref=\"Amos 5:24\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(30,5,24)\">Amos 5:24</ref> (simile of righteousness); <bdbheb>הַשּׁוֺטֵף</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַנּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 32:4\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(14,32,4)\">2Chr 32:4</ref> (|| <bdbheb>מַעְיָנוֺת</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>לְזֶפֶת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נֶהְפְּכוּ נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 34:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,34,9)\">Isa 34:9</ref> simile of tears <ref ref=\"Lam 2:18\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(25,2,18)\">Lam 2:18</ref> hyperb.<bdbheb>שָֿׁ֑מֶן</bdbheb><bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mic 6:7\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(33,6,7)\">Mic 6:7</ref> <highlight>torrents of oil</highlight>, compare of honey and curd <ref ref=\"Job 20:17\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(18,20,17)\">Job 20:17</ref> (|| <bdbheb>פְּלַגּוֺת</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>נְהָרִים</bdbheb>); figurative<bdbheb>בְלִיַּעַל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:5\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,5)\">2Sam 22:5</ref> <highlight>torrents of worthlessness</highlight> (|| <bdbheb>מִשְׁבְּרֵי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>מָ֫וֶת</bdbheb>), = <ref ref=\"Ps 18:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,5)\">Ps 18:5</ref> <bdbheb>שׁוֺטֵף</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> simile of glory of nations <ref ref=\"Isa 66:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,66,12)\">Isa 66:12</ref>, figurative of invaders <ref ref=\"Jer 47:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,47,2)\">Jer 47:2</ref> (|| <bdbheb>מַיִס</bdbheb>), or foes <ref ref=\"Ps 124:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"124\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"124\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,124,4)\">Ps 124:4</ref> (<bdbheb>נַ֫חְלָה</bdbheb>, see above); <ref ref=\"1Kgs 17:4\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(11,17,4)\">1Kgs 17:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 17:6\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(11,17,6)\">1Kgs 17:6</ref> (for drinking), drying up in summer v<ref ref=\"1Kgs 17:7\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(11,17,7)\">1Kgs 17:7</ref> (<bdbheb>יָבֵשׁ</bdbheb>; all of Elijah's stream  <bdbheb><reflink>כְּרִית</reflink></bdbheb>, q. v.); for drinking also <ref ref=\"Ps 110:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"110\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"110\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,110,7)\">Ps 110:7</ref>, and (figurative) <bdbheb>עֲדָנֶיךָ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 36:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,36,9)\">Ps 36:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 6:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,6,15)\">Job 6:15</ref> (twice in verse) (<bdbheb>אֲפִיק</bdbheb> <bdbheb>נְחָלִים</bdbheb>; in simile); of water bursting from rock <ref ref=\"Ps 78:20\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,20)\">Ps 78:20</ref> (<bdbheb>שָׁטַף</bdbheb>, || <bdbheb>מַיִם</bdbheb>), compare <ref ref=\"Ps 74:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"74\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"74\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,74,15)\">Ps 74:15</ref> (+ <bdbheb>מַעְיָן</bdbheb>); figurative of <bdbheb>מְקוֺר חָכְמָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 18:4\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(20,18,4)\">Prov 18:4</ref> (<bdbheb>נֹבֵּעַ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb>; || <bdbheb>מַיִם עֲמֻקִים</bdbheb>); more generally = stream, brook, river (chiefly late) <ref ref=\"Isa 11:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,11,15)\">Isa 11:15</ref> (divisions of river, <bdbheb>נָהָר</bdbheb>) in desert <ref ref=\"Isa 35:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,35,6)\">Isa 35:6</ref> (|| <bdbheb>מַיִם</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Jer 31:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,31,9)\">Jer 31:9</ref> (<bdbheb>נַחֲלֵי מַיִם</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ezek 47:5\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(26,47,5)\">Ezek 47:5</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Ezek 47:9\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(26,47,9)\">Ezek 47:9</ref> b (all strike out <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup>), v<ref ref=\"Ezek 47:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(26,47,6)\">Ezek 47:6</ref> v<ref ref=\"Ezek 47:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,47,7)\">Ezek 47:7</ref> v<ref ref=\"Ezek 47:9\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(26,47,9)\">Ezek 47:9</ref>a (read<bdbheb>הַנַּחַל</bdbheb>, see above), v<ref ref=\"Ezek 47:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,47,12)\">Ezek 47:12</ref> containing fish, etc. <ref ref=\"Lev 11:9\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(3,11,9)\">Lev 11:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 11:10\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(3,11,10)\">Lev 11:10</ref> (|| <bdbheb>מַיִם</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>יַמִּים</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Eccl 1:7\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(21,1,7)\">Eccl 1:7</ref> (twice in verse); figurative <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>רוּחַ י</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Isa 30:28\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(23,30,28)\">Isa 30:28</ref> (<bdbheb>שׁוֺטֵף</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Isa 30:33\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(23,30,33)\">Isa 30:33</ref> (<bdbheb>גָּפְרִית</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb>).</p></div><div class=\"section\"><p></div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>Torrent-valley, wady</highlight>, as stream-bed <ref ref=\"1Sam 17:40\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(9,17,40)\">1Sam 17:40</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 2:15\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(16,2,15)\">Neh 2:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 57:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"57\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"57\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,57,6)\">Isa 57:6</ref> with torrent flowing through it, <bdbheb>אֵיתָן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 21:4\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(5,21,4)\">Deut 21:4</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Deut 21:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,21,6)\">Deut 21:6</ref>, <bdbheb>אֶרֶץ נַחֲלֵי מַיִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 8:7\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(5,8,7)\">Deut 8:7</ref> (|| <bdbheb>עֲיָנֹת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>וּתְהֹמֹת יֹּצְאִים בַּבִּקְעָה</bdbheb>), compare <ref ref=\"Deut 10:7\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(5,10,7)\">Deut 10:7</ref>, <ref ref=\"1Kgs 18:5\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(11,18,5)\">1Kgs 18:5</ref> (|| <bdbheb>מַעְיְנֵי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>הַמַיִם</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ps 104:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"104\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"104\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,104,10)\">Ps 104:10</ref> abode of Elijah <ref ref=\"1Kgs 17:3\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(11,17,3)\">1Kgs 17:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 17:5\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(11,17,5)\">1Kgs 17:5</ref> (compare v<ref ref=\"1Kgs 17:4\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(11,17,4)\">1Kgs 17:4</ref> v<ref ref=\"1Kgs 17:6\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(11,17,6)\">1Kgs 17:6</ref> v<ref ref=\"1Kgs 17:7\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(11,17,7)\">1Kgs 17:7</ref> above); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עֹרְבֵי נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 30:17\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(20,30,17)\">Prov 30:17</ref> (compare <ref ref=\"1Kgs 17:4\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(11,17,4)\">1Kgs 17:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 17:6\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(11,17,6)\">1Kgs 17:6</ref>); <bdbheb>הַבַּתּוֺת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 7:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,19)\">Isa 7:19</ref> as home of bees; fertile, <bdbheb>אֶשְׁכֹּל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 13:23\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(4,13,23)\">Num 13:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 13:24\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(4,13,24)\">Num 13:24</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אִבֵּי הַנּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Song 6:11\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(22,6,11)\">Song 6:11</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עַרְבֵינֿ</bdbheb> <highlight>poplars of the wady</highlight> <ref ref=\"Lev 23:40\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,40)\">Lev 23:40</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Job 40:22\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(18,40,22)\">Job 40:22</ref> <bdbheb>עֲרָבִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 15:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,15,7)\">Isa 15:7</ref> needing water <ref ref=\"Gen 26:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,26,17)\">Gen 26:17</ref> (<bdbheb>גְּרָר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb>), v<ref ref=\"Gen 26:19\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(1,26,19)\">Gen 26:19</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), compare <ref ref=\"2Kgs 3:16\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(12,3,16)\">2Kgs 3:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 3:17\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(12,3,17)\">2Kgs 3:17</ref> place for refuse, ruins, etc. <ref ref=\"2Sam 17:13\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(10,17,13)\">2Sam 17:13</ref> in poetry also as wild, remote ravine <ref ref=\"Job 30:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,30,6)\">Job 30:6</ref>, compare <bdbheb>בְּצוּר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>הַנְּחָלִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 22:24\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(18,22,24)\">Job 22:24</ref> place of child-sacrifice <ref ref=\"Isa 57:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"57\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"57\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,57,5)\">Isa 57:5</ref> burial-place <ref ref=\"Job 21:33\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(18,21,33)\">Job 21:33</ref> (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>רִגְבֵי נ</bdbheb>), — <ref ref=\"Num 24:6\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(4,24,6)\">Num 24:6</ref> see II.  <bdbheb><reflink>נַ֫חַל</reflink></bdbheb>.</p></div><hr><p><u><b>[Note]</b></u></p><p>Particular wadys designate localities: <bdbheb>אַרְנוֺן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 21:14\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(4,21,14)\">Num 21:14</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 2:24\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(5,2,24)\">Deut 2:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 2:36\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(5,2,36)\">Deut 2:36</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Deut 3:8\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,8)\">Deut 3:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 3:12\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,12)\">Deut 3:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 3:16\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,16)\">Deut 3:16</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Deut 4:48\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"48\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"48\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,48)\">Deut 4:48</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 12:1\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(6,12,1)\">Josh 12:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 12:2\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(6,12,2)\">Josh 12:2</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Josh 13:9\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(6,13,9)\">Josh 13:9</ref> (twice in verse) (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>), v<ref ref=\"Josh 13:16\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(6,13,16)\">Josh 13:16</ref> v<ref ref=\"Josh 13:16\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(6,13,16)\">Josh 13:16</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:33\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,33)\">2Kgs 10:33</ref> <bdbheb>אֶשְׁכֹּל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 32:9\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(4,32,9)\">Num 32:9</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 1:24\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(5,1,24)\">Deut 1:24</ref> <bdbheb>בְּשׂוֺר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 30:9\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(9,30,9)\">1Sam 30:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 30:10\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(9,30,10)\">1Sam 30:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 30:21\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(9,30,21)\">1Sam 30:21</ref> <bdbheb>גָּד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 24:5\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(10,24,5)\">2Sam 24:5</ref> <bdbheb>זֶרֶד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 21:12\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"12\" cE